{"speciesId":714,"names":{"fr":"Sonistrelle","es":"Noibat","en":"Noibat","ja":"オンバット"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il apprécie les grottes les plus sombres. Ses grandes oreilles lui permettent de générer des ultrasons d’une fréquence de 200 000 Hz."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Habita en cuevas donde reina la más absoluta oscuridad y emite ondas ultrasónicas de 200 000 Hz a través de sus enormes orejas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They live in pitch-black caves. Their enormous ears can emit ultrasonic waves of 200,000 hertz."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"真っ暗な 洞窟で 暮らす。 ２０万ヘルツの 超音波を 大きな 耳から 発射する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les ultrasons à 200 000 Hz qu’il émet suffiraient à rendre groggy le plus chevronné des lutteurs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ni el más recio de los luchadores profesionales sería capaz de aguantar sus ondas ultrasónicas de 200 000 Hz sin marearse e hincar la rodilla."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Even a robust wrestler will become dizzy and unable to stand when exposed to its 200,000-hertz ultrasonic waves."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"２０万ヘルツの 超音波を 浴びると 屈強な レスラーも 目が 回り 立っていられないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il apprécie les grottes les plus sombres. Ses grandes oreilles lui permettent de générer des ultrasons d’une fréquence de 200 000 Hz."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Habita en cuevas donde reina la más absoluta oscuridad y emite ondas ultrasónicas de 200 000 Hz a través de sus enormes orejas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They live in pitch-black caves. Their enormous ears can emit ultrasonic waves of 200,000 hertz."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"真っ暗な 洞窟で 暮らす。 ２０万ヘルツの 超音波を 大きな 耳から 発射する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les ultrasons à 200 000 Hz qu’il émet suffiraient à rendre groggy le plus chevronné des lutteurs."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ni el más recio de los luchadores profesionales sería capaz de aguantar sus ondas ultrasónicas de 200 000 Hz sin marearse e hincar la rodilla."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Even a robust wrestler will become dizzy and unable to stand when exposed to its 200,000-hertz ultrasonic waves."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"２０万ヘルツの 超音波を 浴びると 屈強な レスラーも 目が 回り 立っていられないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il adore les fruits et, en véritable gourmet, il ne mange que ceux qui sont bien mûrs. Il utilise ses ultrasons pour déterminer le degré de maturité."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Le encanta la fruta, pero es tan selecto que emite ondas ultrasónicas para detectar cuáles están maduras y el resto lo descarta."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Fruits are its favorite foods. This gourmet carefully picks out just the ripe ones using its sonar."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"好物は 果物。 超音波を あてて よく 熟した ものだけを 選び出して 食らう グルメなのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il vole à la recherche de fruits à manger. Il peut déterminer si un fruit est mûr ou non grâce à ses ultrasons."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Revolotea en busca de fruta, su principal fuente de sustento. Con las ondas ultrasónicas que emite puede determinar cuáles están maduras."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It flies around in search of fruit to eat. It uses ultrasonic waves to detect which fruits are ripe."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"エサと なる 果物を 探して 飛びまわる。 熟して いるかを 超音波で 判別 できるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"À la tombée de la nuit, il quitte la grotte où il réside et s’envole à la recherche de fruits mûrs avec ses ultrasons."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Al caer la noche, abandona su cueva y revolotea en busca de fruta madura, que localiza mediante ondas ultrasónicas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"After nightfall, they emerge from the caves they nest in during the day. Using their ultrasonic waves, they go on the hunt for ripened fruit."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"日が 暮れると すみかの 洞窟を 離れて 飛びまわり 完熟の 果物を 超音波で 探す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il peut contrôler des ondes à n’importe quelle fréquence du spectre. Même les plus grands Pokémon ne peuvent supporter ses ultrasons."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su registro vocal cubre todo el espectro de frecuencias. Ni los Pokémon más grandes soportan las ondas ultrasónicas que emite."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"No wavelength of sound is beyond Noibat’s ability to produce. The ultrasonic waves it generates can overcome much larger Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"あらゆる 周波数の 音波を 操る。 超音波を 浴びると 巨体の ポケモンも たまらない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":714,"moves":[{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[15,"level-up",31],[16,"level-up",31],[17,"level-up",31],[18,"level-up",31]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[15,"level-up",11],[16,"level-up",11],[17,"level-up",11],[18,"level-up",11],[20,"level-up",4],[25,"level-up",4]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",16],[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16],[20,"level-up",16],[25,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[15,"level-up",40],[16,"level-up",40],[17,"level-up",40],[18,"level-up",40],[20,"level-up",28],[25,"level-up",28]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[20,"level-up",20],[25,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"supersonic","lea